# PR thermonuclear review (Cursor / Cursor Cloud)

Run in the agent session — not via GitHub Actions.

Before marking a task complete or opening/updating a PR:

1. Run thermonuclear review on the branch diff.
2. Fix CRITICAL and WARNING findings.
3. Re-run review and affected tests (`npm test`, and `npm run qa:web` for `web/` changes).
4. Repeat until no actionable CRITICAL or WARNING items remain.
5. Summarize the final review outcome in the PR description.

Do not skip review for small diffs or follow-up fixes.
